#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:2
msgid "MongoDB - 文档数据库"
msgstr "MongoDB - Document Database"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:4
msgid "MongoDB 是一个开源的跨平台的文档数据库，属于 NoSQL 数据库分类。MongoDB 避开了传统的关系型数据库结构，使用类JSON的动态文档，使得数据的整合更快更简单。 [#]_"
msgstr "MongoDB is an open source, cross-platform document database, classified as a NoSQL database. MongoDB moves away from the traditional relational database structure, using JSON-like dynamic documents, which makes integrating data faster and simpler. [#]_"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:8
msgid "主要功能"
msgstr "Key Features"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:10
msgid "面向文档"
msgstr "Document-oriented"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:12
msgid "与存储标题和作者在两个关系型结构中不同，在 MongoDB 中可以把标题，作者和其他标题相关的信息都存储在一个名为Book中的单个文件。"
msgstr "Unlike storing title and author across two relational structures, in MongoDB you can store the title, author, and other title-related information together in a single document called Book."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:15
msgid "指定查询"
msgstr "Ad hoc queries"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:17
msgid "MongoDB 支持通过字段，范围，正则表达式查询。查询可以返回的文档的特定字段，并且还包括用户定义的JavaScript函数。"
msgstr "MongoDB supports queries by field, range, and regular expression. Queries can return specific fields of the matched documents, and can also include user-defined JavaScript functions."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:20
msgid "索引"
msgstr "Indexing"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:22
msgid "MongoDB 文件中的所有字段都可以索引"
msgstr "Any field in a MongoDB document can be indexed"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:24
msgid "复制"
msgstr "Replication"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:26
msgid "MongoDB 提供了高可用的复制，一个复制集包含两个或多个数据副本。 每个副本可以在任何时间成为主副本或者从副本。主副本提供读和写，从副本保持从主副本复制数据。当主副本下线，从副本将自动成为主副本。"
msgstr "MongoDB provides high-availability replication; a replica set contains two or more copies of the data. Each copy can become the primary or a secondary at any time. The primary handles reads and writes, while secondaries keep replicating data from the primary. When the primary goes offline, a secondary automatically becomes the new primary."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:29
msgid "负载均衡"
msgstr "Load balancing"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:31
msgid "MongoDB 可以运行在多个服务器，负载均衡和复制数据，保证系统启动并在出现硬件故障时运行。"
msgstr "MongoDB can run across multiple servers, load-balancing and replicating data, ensuring the system starts up and keeps running in the event of a hardware failure."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:33
msgid "文件存储"
msgstr "File storage"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:35
msgid "MongoDB 可以作为一个文件系统使用，有利于负载均衡和数据复制。这个功能，称为 GridFS，被包含在MongoDB 驱动中。"
msgstr "MongoDB can be used as a file system, which is helpful for load balancing and data replication. This feature, called GridFS, is included in the MongoDB drivers."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:39
msgid "安装"
msgstr "Installation"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:49
msgid "配置"
msgstr "Configuration"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:51
msgid "/etc/mongod.conf mongoDB的配置文件"
msgstr "/etc/mongod.conf mongoDB's configuration file"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:53
msgid "/var/lib/mongodb 数据文件"
msgstr "/var/lib/mongodb data files"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:55
msgid "/var/log/mongodb 日志文件"
msgstr "/var/log/mongodb log files"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:58
msgid "入门知识"
msgstr "Getting Started"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:60
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Document"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:62
msgid "文档是 MongoDB 中数据的基本单元，非常类似于关系数据库中的行。 文档是键值对的一个有序集，键是字符串，值可以是多种不同的数据类型。 文档必须有一个 \\_id 键。键的值默认是ObjectId类型"
msgstr "A document is the basic unit of data in MongoDB, very similar to a row in a relational database. A document is an ordered set of key-value pairs, where keys are strings and values can be many different data types. Every document must have an \\_id key. The value of that key defaults to the ObjectId type"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:66
msgid "集合"
msgstr "Collection"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:68
msgid "集合是一组文档，相当于表。在一个集合里面，文档的 \\_id 是唯一的。"
msgstr "A collection is a group of documents, equivalent to a table. Within a collection, each document's \\_id is unique."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:70
msgid "数据库"
msgstr "Database"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:72
msgid "多个集合组成数据库"
msgstr "Multiple collections make up a database"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:75
msgid "CRUD 操作"
msgstr "CRUD Operations"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:77
msgid "插入"
msgstr "Insert"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:79
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.test.insert({\"\":}) 插入的数据必须小于16M"
msgstr "db.test.insert({\"\":}) inserted data must be smaller than 16M"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:82
msgid "删除"
msgstr "Delete"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:84
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.test.remove({\"\":}) emove函数接受键值参数作为删除条件"
msgstr "db.test.remove({\"\":}) the remove function accepts key-value parameters as the deletion condition"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:87
msgid "更新"
msgstr "Update"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:89
msgid "$set"
msgstr "$set"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:91
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$set 用来更新一个键的值，如果键不存在，则创建。 db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$set\":{\"fa\":\"War and peace\",\"wow\":\"lol\"}})"
msgstr "$set is used to update a key's value; if the key doesn't exist, it's created. db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$set\":{\"fa\":\"War and peace\",\"wow\":\"lol\"}})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:97
msgid "$unset"
msgstr "$unset"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:99
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$unset 用来清除一个键值 db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$unset\":{\"fa\":1}})"
msgstr "$unset is used to clear a key's value db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$unset\":{\"fa\":1}})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:104
msgid "$inc"
msgstr "$inc"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:106
#, python-brace-format
msgid "$inc 用来增加一个键的值，如果键不存在，则创建。 db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$inc\":{\"fa\":55}})"
msgstr "$inc is used to increase a key's value; if the key doesn't exist, it's created. db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$inc\":{\"fa\":55}})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:111
msgid "upsert"
msgstr "upsert"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:113
#, python-brace-format
msgid "将 update 的第三个参数设置为 true upsert 可以避免竟态问题 db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$inc\":{\"fa\":55}}, true)"
msgstr "Setting update's third parameter to true enables upsert, which can avoid race conditions db.blog.update({\"_id\":ObjectId(\"5603697db13466f29ba8e673\")},{\"$inc\":{\"fa\":55}}, true)"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:120
msgid "更新多个文档"
msgstr "Updating multiple documents"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:122
#, python-brace-format
msgid "update默认情况只能对符合匹配条件的第一个文档执行更新。 要更新多个文档需要将 update 的第四个参数设置为 true db.blog.update({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"},{\"$set\":{\"123\":456}},true,true)"
msgstr "By default, update only updates the first document matching the condition. To update multiple documents, set update's fourth parameter to true db.blog.update({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"},{\"$set\":{\"123\":456}},true,true)"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:127
msgid "查询"
msgstr "Query"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:129
msgid "mongoDB使用 find 来查询集合中的文档。"
msgstr "mongoDB uses find to query documents within a collection."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:131
msgid "db.blog.find()"
msgstr "db.blog.find()"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:133
msgid "批量返回集合blog中的所有文档"
msgstr "Returns all documents in the blog collection in bulk"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:135
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.blog.find({\"age\":27})"
msgstr "db.blog.find({\"age\":27})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:137
#, python-brace-format
msgid "返回键值包含 {\"age\":27} 的文档"
msgstr "Returns documents whose key-values include {\"age\":27}"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:139
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.blog.find({\"title\":\"second\", \"age\":27})"
msgstr "db.blog.find({\"title\":\"second\", \"age\":27})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:141
#, python-brace-format
msgid "返回键值包含{\"title\":\"second\"} AND {\"age\":27} 的文档"
msgstr "Returns documents whose key-values include {\"title\":\"second\"} AND {\"age\":27}"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:143
msgid "find 的第二参数用于限定要返回的文档的键值。"
msgstr "find's second parameter is used to restrict which keys of the matched documents are returned."

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:145
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.blog.find({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"}, {\"conntent\":1})"
msgstr "db.blog.find({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"}, {\"conntent\":1})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:147
msgid "返回值仅包含 _id 和 conntent 键"
msgstr "The return value only includes the _id and conntent keys"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:149
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.blog.find({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"}, {\"conntent\":0, \"title\":0})"
msgstr "db.blog.find({\"title\" : \"second blog post\"}, {\"conntent\":0, \"title\":0})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:151
msgid "返回值不包含 conntent 和 title 键"
msgstr "The return value excludes the conntent and title keys"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:153
msgid "$lt $lte $gt $gte $ne 对应 < <= > >= ≠"
msgstr "$lt $lte $gt $gte $ne correspond to < <= > >= ≠"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:155
#, python-brace-format
msgid "db.blog.find({\"age\":{\"$gte\":18,\"$lt\":30}})"
msgstr "db.blog.find({\"age\":{\"$gte\":18,\"$lt\":30}})"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:157
msgid "返回 age 大于18小于30的文档"
msgstr "Returns documents where age is greater than 18 and less than 30"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:160
msgid "文件存取操作"
msgstr "File Storage Operations"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:162
msgid "文件存取基于二进制数据类型，下面用 python 进行文件存储操作"
msgstr "File storage is based on the binary data type; below, python is used to perform file storage operations"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:175
msgid "验证"
msgstr "Verify"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:183
msgid "写入"
msgstr "Write"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:193
msgid "GridFS"
msgstr "GridFS"

#: ../../linux/mongodb.rst:195
msgid "Gridfs是用来支持大小超过16MB的文件的，不超过16M的文件存成文档就行了。Gridfs 的理念是：将大文件分割为多个块，将每个块作为独立的文档进行存储。"
msgstr "GridFS is used to support files larger than 16MB; files under 16M can simply be stored as documents. GridFS's approach is: split a large file into multiple chunks, and store each chunk as an independent document."

